<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF seeks 52,500 tonnes of corn.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF seeks 52,500 tonnes of corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) has invited tenders for 52,500 tonnes of No.3 yellow corn by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Thursday, an official with the NLCF said.  </p>
<p>The NLCF official said the amount of 52,500 tonnes was previously passed up during tenders last Tuesday.</p>
<p>It would recieve both offers for basis and flat.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>    TONNE   ETA	   SHIPMENT</p>
<p>    52,500  April 25    Mar 25-Apr 13 (PNW)</p>
<p>				Mar 6-25 (U.S. Gulf)</p>
<p>				Apr 1-15 (China)</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
